# Alice's other device (e2e/peer.ts, the one that turned the lock on) taken out of it from this phone (设置 › 安全 ›
# 移除): said what that means first, then gone from the station's lock, this phone alice's one device left in it.
#only android
timeout 120000
until 端到端测试
tap icon:settings
until =安全
tap =安全
until 成员和设备
shot 1-security
tap 移除
until 该设备将无法再访问受保护的 station
shot 2-confirm
tap =移除
until 已移除
shot 3-removed
